*Beta 27.0: New card: Golden Hit. RARE Spell. SOUL: Integrity. EFFECT: Spend all your gold and deal DMG to an enemy monster equals to the amount spent. Convert extra DMG into Gold
*Beta 32.1: No longer ignores DMG reducing effects.
**Previously, this card would ignore DMG reducing effects such as Armor when checking for the extra DMG. This has now been fixed, making it work properly like [[Casual Undyne]], [[Worsening]], and [[Rage]].
*Beta 33.0: Updated sprite. 
**The Integrity spells [[Fortune]], [[Expulsion]] and [[Cloning]] also got updated sprites.
*Beta 101.0: EFFECT UPDATE: Loop (1). Spend all your G and deal DMG to an enemy monster equal to the amount spent. Earn G equal to excess DMG dealt.
